<title>INDIA: India's HFCL 96/97 net down.</title>
<headline>India's HFCL 96/97 net down.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     165.8  vs    416.8</p>
<p>    Gross turnover     2,000.2  vs  2,432.9</p>
<p>    Other income	   206.2  vs    167.8</p>
<p>Total expenditure  1,580.5  vs  1,684.6</p>
<p>Interest and</p>
<p>	  finance charges 198.7   vs    161.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   57.1   vs     46.6</p>
<p>    Provision for tax    24.7   vs     21.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Himachal Futuristic Communications Ltd manufactures a range of telecommunications equipment in the small north Indian state of Himachal Pradesh.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
